Include the header that declares uint32_t in glslang's SPIR-V builder.
GCC 16's libstdc++ no longer provides it through the container headers, so
MSYS2's MINGW64 build otherwise fails here.
Upstream: not proposed

diff --git a/vendor/glslang/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h b/vendor/glslang/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h
--- a/vendor/glslang/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h
+++ b/vendor/glslang/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@ namespace spv {
 }
 
 #include <algorithm>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <map>
 #include <memory>
 #include <set>
